## 1. Where this project comes from

Mirako Machine began as a fork of
[samsulpanjul/umamusume-auto-train](https://github.com/samsulpanjul/umamusume-auto-train),
by way of the
[CrazyIvanTR/umamusume-auto-train](https://github.com/CrazyIvanTR/umamusume-auto-train)
fork, and that original project was itself inspired by
[shiokaze/UmamusumeAutoTrainer](https://github.com/shiokaze/UmamusumeAutoTrainer).
The full history, and what changed in this build, is in
[`CREDITS.md`](./CREDITS.md).

**Honesty note:** the licensing of the upstream projects is UNCONFIRMED. Their
license terms could not be established, and no licence covering the upstream
code that remained in this tree has ever been granted by or from their
authors. This license therefore asserts no grant of rights from the upstream
projects, and gives no rights in or to them. It covers only what this
repository itself ships, and only the rights its author can give.

## 2. What you may do

Anyone may download, run, modify and share this project, subject to all of
the following conditions:

1. **Your own copy.** The project automates your personal, legally owned
   copy of the game *Umamusume*. It is not a way to access, play or
   distribute the game, and nothing in this repository is the game or
   replaces it.
2. **The game's rules still apply.** You are responsible for complying with
   the game's Terms of Service and any applicable law. Automation may
   trigger detection and enforcement; any ban or suspension of your account
   is your own risk.
3. **Keep the notices.** If you share the project or a modified version,
   keep [`LICENSE`](./LICENSE),
   [`LICENSE_AND_DISCLAIMER.md`](./LICENSE_AND_DISCLAIMER.md) and
   [`CREDITS.md`](./CREDITS.md) intact, so every downstream user sees the
   same terms and acknowledgements.

Commercial use is reserved. This project may not be sold, offered for sale,
or used to provide a paid service of any kind. The author reserves all
rights of commercial exploitation.

## 3. The game is not ours

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Cygames or
by any other publisher, developer or rights holder of *Umamusume*
(*Uma Musume: Pretty Derby*). All game assets, character and scenario names,
music, artwork and trademarks encountered in or shipped with the project
belong to their respective owners. The game assets that ship here are used
solely to make the automation work — not to play, display or distribute
game content.

